== Dangers ==

*Virtually all the monsters here are dragons or dragonkin, and are very powerful. If you are not allied with [[Claws of Veeshan]] this zone can be very dangerous without a group. Even if you are allied with [[Claws of Veeshan]], you should stay invisible, because there are monsters here that will attack anyone.

*Certain mobs will attack anyone regardless of faction and certain dragons that are on separate faction from [[Claws of Veeshan]] so make sure to con them first.

*Many of the creatures in this zone may run very fast. Wolves run at SoW speed. Wyverns (unlike the wyverns in [[Cobalt Scar]]) and Rhinos run at about JBoots speed.

*Pathing in this zone is astonishingly bad for an outdoor zone, mobs tend to warp and start summoning.

*Chain aggro occurs very frequently, It is very easy to get mobbed by monsters when you least expect it.

*A form of levitate is greatly recommended to not fall off one of the various high hills or cliffs.

== Benefits ==

*Most of the Dragons drop [[Dragon Talismans]], giving +4 to +7 to all stats and saves.

*Many of these mobs drop 50+ Kunark/Velious spells.

== Traveling To and From Western Wastes ==

*The Western Wastes can be reached by passing through [[Siren's Grotto]].

*There are 2 zones that branch off of the Western Wastes. The first is a '''one-way entrance''' to the [[Temple of Veeshan]] located at +700, +700. The second is the entrance to [[Dragon Necropolis]] located at -2800, +380.

